    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλαγμ-α</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>emollient</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.946
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Goodsp.</u>
				30
			</span></i> X <i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>soft materials, padding</i>, used in sieges to blunt the force
			of engines and weapons, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				91.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				95.47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τῆς ἀντιτυπίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.618f
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				70d
			</span></i>, ap. <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				32.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάγματος χάριν</span> for
				<i>padding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.28.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἕνεκα</span>, of a shirt worn
			under armour, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.31
			</span></i>.</div>
